From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 09:07:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] ci: Store the device WPT results only when every test ran

When wptrunner can't start Servo again, e.g. because the board
rebooted, it gives up on the remaining tests, and `--always-succeed`
makes the run succeed anyway. The first QuickJS nightly run stopped
after 5,577 of its 17,887 tests and stored them. A step now compares the
number of tests in the raw log's suite_start with the number of
test_end events, and fails the job if tests are missing, so the results
aren't stored and the run shows up as failed. The logs are still
uploaded.

Validation: the step's script, extracted from the workflow and run with `uv run --no-project python` as on the runner, passes a complete local DAYU200 run (1596 of 1596) and a 2-test run, and fails a copy of the first log cut to 1000 test_end events (exit 1 with the error annotation); actionlint passes, apart from its warnings about the local actions' metadata and the runner label.
AI-assisted: Yes (agent session; written by the agent)
Signed-off-by: Jonathan Schwender <schwenderjonathan@gmail.com>
---
 .github/workflows/ohos-device-wpt.yml | 22 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 22 insertions(+)

diff --git a/.github/workflows/ohos-device-wpt.yml b/.github/workflows/ohos-device-wpt.yml
index 28e1daab823..984de81b7c5 100644
--- a/.github/workflows/ohos-device-wpt.yml
+++ b/.github/workflows/ohos-device-wpt.yml
@@ -181,6 +181,28 @@ jobs:
           ./mach test-wpt --ohos --profile "$PROFILE" --js-engine quickjs --processes 2 --always-succeed \
             --log-raw wpt-full-logs/raw.log --log-wptreport wpt-full-logs/linux/wptreport/1.json \
             $TESTS
+      # wptrunner gives up on the remaining tests when it can't start Servo again, e.g. after the
+      # board rebooted, and `--always-succeed` hides that. A partial run must not be stored, as its
+      # scores aren't comparable.
+      - name: Check that all tests ran
+        run: |
+          uv run --no-project python - wpt-full-logs/raw.log <<'EOF'
+          import json
+          import sys
+
+          planned = ended = 0
+          with open(sys.argv[1]) as log:
+              for line in log:
+                  event = json.loads(line)
+                  if event["action"] == "suite_start":
+                      planned += sum(len(tests) for tests in event["tests"].values())
+                  elif event["action"] == "test_end":
+                      ended += 1
+          print(f"{ended} of {planned} tests ran")
+          if ended < planned:
+              print(f"::error::Only {ended} of the {planned} tests ran, so the results aren't stored")
+              sys.exit(1)
+          EOF
       - name: Upload the results
         if: ${{ !cancelled() }}
         uses: actions/upload-artifact@v7
